t;User can keep talking!&lt;/text&gt;&lt;line x1=&quot;576&quot; y1=&quot;643&quot; x2=&quot;610&quot; y2=&quot;643&quot; stroke=&quot;#059669&quot; stroke-width=&quot;2.6&quot;/&gt;&lt;polygon points=&quot;606,638 615,643 606,648&quot; fill=&quot;#059669&quot;/&gt;&lt;rect x=&quot;616&quot; y=&quot;602&quot; width=&quot;216&quot; height=&quot;82&quot; rx=&quot;12&quot; fill=&quot;#ECFDF5&quot; stroke=&quot;#059669&quot; stroke-width=&quot;1.8&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;724&quot; y=&quot;624&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;9.6&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#065F46&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;3. Seamless Voice Merge&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;724&quot; y=&quot;644&quot; font-family=&quot;Courier New,monospace&quot; font-size=&quot;8.2&quot; font-weight=&quot;800&quot; fill=&quot;#047857&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;Speaks grounded result&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;724&quot; y=&quot;664&quot; font-family=&quot;Courier New,monospace&quot; font-size=&quot;8.2&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#059669&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;0 awkward 5-sec pauses&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;460&quot; y=&quot;738&quot; font-family=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;9.8&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#0F172A&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot;&gt;LIVE API INNOVATION: Separate instant speech turn-taking from background extended-thinking tools!&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="920" height="1150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

